	["In addition to allowing any 'while on Consecrated Ground' modifiers to apply,\nConsecrated Ground grants 5% ^xE05030Life ^7Regeneration to players and allies."] = "除了允許任何『在奉獻地面上』修飾詞生效外，奉獻地面會賦予玩家及同伴5% ^xE05030生命 ^7再生。",
