	["The Parry debuff grants:\n	Enemies take 50% more Attack Damage"] = "招架減益提供：\n	敵人承受 50% 更多攻擊傷害",
	["The Trader feature supports two modes of operation depending on the authorization availability.\nYou can click this button to authorize PoB by logging in.\n\n^2Session Mode^7\n- Requires authorization on pathofexile.com.\n- You can search, compare, and quickly import items without leaving Path of Building.\n- You can select an item and search it directly.\n- You can generate and perform searches for the private leagues you are participating.\n\n^xFF9922No Session Mode^7\n- Doesn't require authorization.\n- You cannot search and compare items in Path of Building.\n- You can generate weighted search URLs but have to visit the trade site and manually import items.\n- You can only generate weighted searches for public leagues. (Generated searches can be modified\non trade site to work on other leagues and realms)"] = "Trader 功能會依授權狀態提供兩種操作模式。\n你可以點擊此按鈕登入並授權 PoB。\n\n^2Session 模式^7\n- 需要在 pathofexile.com 完成授權。\n- 你可以在 Path of Building 內搜尋、比較並快速匯入物品。\n- 你可以選取物品並直接搜尋。\n- 你可以為自己參與的私人聯盟產生並執行搜尋。\n\n^xFF9922無 Session 模式^7\n- 不需要授權。\n- 你無法在 Path of Building 內搜尋和比較物品。\n- 你可以產生加權搜尋 URL，但必須前往交易網站並手動匯入物品。\n- 你只能為公開聯盟產生加權搜尋。產生的搜尋可在交易網站上修改，\n以支援其他聯盟和 realm。",
	["The URL is also copied to the clipboard."] = "網址也會複製到剪貼簿。",
	["The account has no characters to import."] = "此帳號沒有可匯入的角色。",
	["The amount of valour consumed for the placed banner"] = "已放置旗幟所消耗的勇武量",
	["The build you are trying to load uses an unrecognised version of the passive skill tree.\nYou may need to update the program before loading this build."] = "你嘗試載入的構築使用了無法辨識版本的天賦樹。\n在載入此構築前，你可能需要先更新程式。",
	["The enemy will automatically be considered to be Cursed if you have at least one curse enabled,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你至少啟用一個詛咒，敵人會自動視為已受詛咒，\n但必要時你可以用此選項強制設定。",
	["The enemy will automatically be considered to be Unique if they are a Boss.\nUsed to set base Culling Strike Threshold."] = "若敵人是 Boss，將自動視為傳奇。\n用於設定基礎斬殺門檻。",
	["The folder is not empty."] = "資料夾不是空的。",
	["The folder is not empty.\nAre you sure you want to delete folder:"] = "資料夾不是空的。\n確定要刪除資料夾：",
	["The folder is not empty.\nAre you sure you want to delete folder:\n%s\nThis cannot be undone."] = "資料夾不是空的。\n確定要刪除資料夾:\n%s\n此操作無法復原。",
	["The item is invalid."] = "物品無效。",
	["The percentage of the roll range the enemy hits for \n eg at 100% the enemy deals its maximum damage"] = "敵人命中的擲值範圍百分比 \n 例如在 100% 時，敵人會造成最大傷害",
	["The total life of your Spectres that can be taken before yours (used by jinxed juju)"] = "你的靈體可在你之前承受的總生命值（用於 jinxed juju）",
	["The total life of your Totems (excluding Vaal Rejuvenation Totem) that can be taken before yours (used by totem mastery)"] = "你的圖騰（不含 Vaal Rejuvenation Totem）可在你之前承受的總生命值（用於圖騰專精）",
	["The total life of your Vaal Rejuvenation Totems that can be taken before yours"] = "你的 Vaal Rejuvenation Totem 可在你之前承受的總生命值",
	["The trade site will filter out listings with other currencies,\nif anything other than \"Exalted Orb Equivalent\" is chosen and a maximum is specified."] = "若選擇「Exalted Orb Equivalent」以外的任何貨幣，\n且已指定上限，交易網站會過濾掉使用其他貨幣的刊登。",
	["The tree has been converted to"] = "天賦樹已轉換為",
	["The tree has been converted to %s.\nNote that some or all of the passives may have been de-allocated due to changes in the tree.\n\nYou can switch back to the old tree using the tree selector at the bottom left."] = "天賦樹已轉換為 %s。\n請注意，由於天賦樹變更，部分或全部被動天賦可能已被取消配置。\n\n你可以使用左下角的天賦樹選擇器切回舊天賦樹。",
	["Thirst for Blood"] = "鮮血渴求",
