	["This also implies you have 'Consumed a corpse Recently'"] = "這也表示你有「近期消耗屍體」",
	["This applies -20% ^x3F6DB3Cold Resistance ^7to the enemy."] = "此效果對敵人施加 -20% ^x3F6DB3冰霜抗性^7。",
	["This applies -20% ^xADAA47Lightning Resistance ^7to the enemy."] = "此效果對敵人施加 -20% ^xADAA47閃電抗性^7。",
	["This applies -20% ^xB97123Fire Resistance ^7to the enemy."] = "此效果對敵人施加 -20% ^xB97123火焰抗性^7。",
	["This build has unsaved changes.\nDo you want to save them"] = "這個構築有未儲存的變更。\n要儲存嗎",
	["This build has unsaved changes.\nDo you want to save them before exiting?"] = "此配裝有未儲存的變更。\n要在離開前儲存嗎?",
	["This build has unsaved changes.\nDo you want to save them before updating?"] = "此配裝有未儲存的變更。\n要在更新前儲存嗎?",
	["This build has unsaved changes.\nDo you want to save them now?"] = "此配裝有未儲存的變更。\n要立即儲存嗎?",
	["This can be useful if transforming certain notables would break your build."] = "如果轉換某些核心天賦會破壞你的配裝，這會很有用。",
	["This can be useful if you're never going to path towards those excluded nodes and don't care what happens to them."] = "如果你永遠不會走向那些被排除的節點，且不在意它們會變成什麼，這會很有用。",
	["This cannot be undone."] = "此操作無法復原。",
	["This config option is conditional with missing source and is invalid."] = "此配置選項有條件限制，但缺少來源，因此無效。",
	["This contains a list of your desired nodes along with their primary, secondary, and minimum weights."] = "這包含你想要的節點清單，以及它們的主要、次要與最低權重。",
	["This contains a list of your fallback nodes along with their primary, secondary, and minimum weights."] = "這包含你的備用節點清單，以及它們的主要、次要與最低權重。",
	["This controls the maximum amount of points that need to be spent to grab a node before its filtered out"] = "這會控制取得節點前最多需要花費多少點數，超過就會被篩掉",
	["This effect will only be applied while you can inflict ^x3F6DB3Brittle."] = "只有在你能施加 ^x3F6DB3脆弱 時才會套用此效果。",
	["This effect will only be applied while you can inflict ^xB97123Scorched."] = "只有在你能施加 ^xB97123灼燒 時才會套用此效果。",
	["This is a list of item sets that will be shared\nbetween all of your builds.\nYou can add sets to this list by dragging them\nfrom the build's set list."] = "這是一份會在所有構築之間共用的物品組合清單。\n你可以從構築的組合清單拖曳物品組合到這個清單來加入。",
	["This is a list of items that will be shared between all of\nyour builds.\nYou can add items to this list by dragging them from\none of the other lists."] = "這是一份會在所有構築之間共用的物品清單。\n你可以從其他清單拖曳物品到這個清單來加入。",
	["This is a special group created for the '%s^7' skill,\nwhich is being provided by %s.\nYou cannot delete this group, but it will disappear if you un-allocate the node."] = "這是為「%s^7」技能建立的特殊群組，\n由 %s 提供。\n你不能刪除此群組，但若你取消配置該節點，它會消失。",
	["This is a special group created for the '%s^7' skill,\nwhich is being provided by %s.\nYou cannot delete this group, but it will disappear if you un-equip the item."] = "這是為「%s^7」技能建立的特殊群組，\n由 %s 提供。\n你不能刪除此群組，但若你卸下該物品，它會消失。",
	["This is a special group created for the enemy explosion effect,\nwhich comes from the following sources:"] = "這是為敵人爆炸效果建立的特殊群組，\n來源如下:",
	["This is an older tree version, which may not be fully compatible with the current game version."] = "這是較舊的天賦樹版本，可能與目前遊戲版本不完全相容。",
	["This is automatically enabled if you have a charm active,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "如果你有啟用護符，這個選項會自動開啟，\n但必要時你可以用此選項強制啟用。",
	["This is automatically enabled if you have a flask active,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "如果你有啟用藥劑，這個選項會自動開啟，\n但必要時你可以用此選項強制啟用。",
	["This is the list of items that have been added to this build.\nYou can add items to this list by dragging them from\none of the other lists, or by clicking 'Add to build' when\nviewing an item."] = "這是已加入此構築的物品清單。\n你可以從其他清單拖曳物品到這個清單，\n或在檢視物品時點擊「加入構築」來加入。",
	["This list can be updated manually or by selecting the node you want to update via the search dropdown list and then moving the node weight sliders."] = "此清單可手動更新，也可從搜尋下拉清單選取要更新的節點，然後調整節點權重滑桿。",
	["This multiplies the damage of a given skill in pvp, for instance any with damage multiplier specific to pvp (from skill or support or item like sire of shards)"] = "這會倍率化某個技能在 PvP 中的傷害，例如任何具有特定 PvP 傷害倍率的效果（來自技能、輔助，或像 Sire of Shards 這類物品）。",
	["This node is granted by an item. Removing it will cause no changes"] = "此節點由物品提供。移除它不會產生變化",
	["This node is granted by an item. Removing it will give you:"] = "此節點由物品提供。移除它會給予你:",
	["This option enables Manastorm's ^xADAA47Lightning ^7Damage Buff.\n(When you cast a Spell, Sacrifice all ^x7070FFMana ^7to gain Added Maximum ^xADAA47Lightning ^7Damage\nequal to 50% of Sacrificed ^x7070FFMana ^7for 4 seconds)"] = "這個選項會啟用 Manastorm 的 ^xADAA47閃電^7 傷害增益。\n（當你施放法術時，犧牲所有 ^x7070FF魔力^7 來獲得額外最大 ^xADAA47閃電^7 傷害，\n數值等於所犧牲 ^x7070FF魔力^7 的 50%，持續 4 秒）",
	["This option enables the Everlasting Sacrifice buff that grants +5% to all maximum resists."] = "這個選項會啟用【永恆獻祭】增益，讓所有最大抗性 +5%。",
	["This option is specific to '%s'."] = "此選項專屬於 '%s'。",
	["This option is specific to Arborix."] = "此選項專屬於 Arborix。",
	["This option is specific to Augyre."] = "此選項專屬於 Augyre。",
	["This option is specific to Oni-Goroshi."] = "此選項專屬於 Oni-Goroshi。",
	["This option is specific to Vulconus."] = "此選項專屬於 Vulconus。",
	["This option prevents EE from being reset by the hit damage of your main skill."] = "此選項可防止 EE 因你的主要技能命中傷害而重置。",
	["This option sets the Movement Speed from Gamblesprint boots."] = "此選項設定 Gamblesprint 靴子的移動速度。",
	["This option sets whether an enemy is between you and your linked target."] = "此選項設定敵人是否位於你與你的連結目標之間。",
	["This option sets whether or not the enemy has hit you with ^x3F6DB3Cold Damage^7 in the last 4 seconds."] = "此選項設定敵人是否在過去 4 秒內以 ^x3F6DB3寒冷傷害^7 擊中過你。",
	["This option sets whether or not the enemy has hit you with ^xADAA47Lightning Damage^7 in the last 4 seconds."] = "此選項設定敵人是否在過去 4 秒內以 ^xADAA47閃電傷害^7 擊中過你。",
	["This option sets whether or not the enemy has hit you with ^xB97123Fire Damage^7 in the last 4 seconds."] = "此選項設定敵人是否在過去 4 秒內以 ^xB97123火焰傷害^7 擊中過你。",
	["This overrides the default damage amount used to estimate your damage reduction from armour.\nThe default is 1.5 times the enemy's base damage, which is the same value\nused in-game to calculate the estimate shown on the character sheet."] = "此選項會覆寫用來估算你從護甲獲得的傷害減免所使用的預設傷害量。\n預設值是敵人基礎傷害的 1.5 倍，這也是遊戲內用來計算角色面板上顯示的估算值所使用的數值。",
	["This overrides the default enemy level used to estimate your hit, ^x33FF77evade ^7chance, and damage reduction.\n\nThe maximum level for normal enemies and all bosses is 85.\n\nThe default level of normal enemies and bosses scales with player level unless manually set.\n\nThe default and minimum level for pinnacle bosses and uber pinnacle bosses is 82."] = "此選項會覆寫用來估算你的命中、^x33FF77閃避^7機率與傷害減免的預設敵人等級。\n\n一般敵人與所有首領的最高等級為 85。\n\n一般敵人與首領的預設等級會隨玩家等級縮放，除非手動設定。\n\n巔峰首領與超巔峰首領的預設與最低等級為 82。",
	["This sets the import button to append to the current party lists instead of replacing them (curses will still replace)"] = "這會讓匯入按鈕附加到目前隊伍列表，而不是取代它們 (詛咒仍會取代)",
	["This shows the advanced info like what stats each aura/curse etc are adding, as well as enables the ability to edit them without a re-export\nDo not edit any boxes unless you know what you are doing, use copy/paste or import instead"] = "這會顯示進階資訊，例如各光環/詛咒等加入了哪些屬性，也允許不重新匯出就編輯它們\n除非你知道自己在做什麼，否則不要編輯任何欄位；請改用複製/貼上或匯入",
	["This slider controls the weight of the following stat:"] = "此滑桿控制下列屬性的權重:",
	["This socket group cannot be deleted as it is created by an equipped item."] = "此插槽組無法刪除，因為它是由已裝備物品建立的。",
	["This will allow the skill to benefit from modifiers on the item that affect socketed gems."] = "這會讓該技能受益於物品上影響鑲嵌寶石的詞綴。",
	["This will enable the Adrenaline buff, which grants:\n	100% increased Damage\n	25% increased Attack, Cast and Movement Speed\n	10% additional Physical Damage Reduction"] = "啟用可賦予以下加成的腎上腺素增益：\n	傷害提高 100%\n	攻擊、施放與移動速度提高 25%\n	額外 10% 物理傷害減免",
	["This will enable the Alchemist's Genius buff:\n20% increased Flask Charges gained\n10% increased effect of Flasks"] = "這將啟用【鍊金奇才】增益：\n充能獲得提高 20%\n藥劑效果提高 10%",
	["This will enable the Chaotic Might buff on your minions.\n(Grants 30% of Physical Damage as Extra ^xD02090Chaos ^7Damage)"] = "這將啟用你召喚物的【混亂之力】增益。\n（賦予30% 物理傷害作為額外的 ^xD02090混沌 ^7傷害）",
	["This will enable the Chaotic Might buff.\n(Grants 30% of Physical Damage as Extra ^xD02090Chaos ^7Damage)"] = "這將啟用【混沌之力】增益。\n（賦予30% 物理傷害作為額外的 ^xD02090混沌 ^7傷害）",
