	["Weapon Set:"] = "武器組合：",
	["Weighted Sum searches will always sort using descending weighted sum\nAdditional post filtering options can be done these include:\nHighest Stat Value - Sort from highest to lowest Stat Value change of equipping item\nHighest Stat Value / Price - Sorts from highest to lowest by estimated Stat Value per currency\nLowest Price - Sorts from lowest to highest price of retrieved items\nHighest Weight - Displays the order retrieved from trade"] = "加權總和搜尋一律依加權總和由高到低排序\n也可以再套用下列後置篩選選項:\n最高屬性值 - 依裝備物品後的屬性值變化由高到低排序\n最高屬性值 / 價格 - 依每單位通貨的估計屬性值由高到低排序\n最低價格 - 依擷取物品的價格由低到高排序\n最高權重 - 顯示交易回傳的順序",
	["When In Combat"] = "戰鬥中",
	["When enabled, an estimate of the offensive and defensive strength of\neach unallocated passive is calculated and displayed visually.\nOffensive power shows as %s, defensive power as %s."] = "啟用後，會計算每個未配置被動天賦的攻擊與防禦強度估算，\n並以視覺方式顯示。\n攻擊強度顯示為 %s，防禦強度顯示為 %s。",
	["When enabled, the mana spent by Arcane Cloak used at full mana \nwill be added to the value provided in # of ^x7070FFMana ^7spent Recently."] = "啟用時，以滿魔力施放 Arcane Cloak 所消耗的魔力\n會計入「# 近期消耗的 ^x7070FF魔力 ^7：」所提供的數值。",
	["While affected by Unravelling, your ^xD02090Chaos^7 Damage randomly either also contributes to ^x3F6DB3Freeze^7 buildup,\n^xB97123Ignite^7 chance and magnitude, or ^xADAA47Shock^7 chance - changing which it contributes to every two seconds."] = "受【解構】影響時，你的 ^xD02090混沌^7 傷害會隨機地同時也貢獻於 ^x3F6DB3冰凍^7 累積、\n^xB97123點燃^7 機率與強度，或 ^xADAA47感電^7 機率，並每兩秒改變其貢獻對象。",
	["While ensnared, enemies take increased Projectile Damage from Attack Hits\nEnsnared enemies always count as moving, and have less movement speed while trying to break the snare."] = "被纏繞時，敵人會從攻擊命中的投射物傷害中承受更多傷害\n被纏繞的敵人一律視為正在移動，且在試圖掙脫纏繞時移動速度較低。",
