	["You are surrounded if there are at least 5 Enemies within 3 metres of you"] = "若你 3 公尺內至少有 5 名敵人，則視為被包圍",
	["You can click to select a row so that search begins from there."] = "你可以點擊選取一列，讓搜尋從該處開始。",
	["You can switch attributes quicker by holding hotkeys while allocating:\n%s\"1\" or \"I\" for Intelligence, %s\"2\" or \"S\" for Strength, %s\"3\" or \"D\" for Dexterity\n\n%sRight-click ^8an allocated node to toggle attribute types or to set an\nunallocated node to your last used attribute\n\n"] = "配置時按住快捷鍵可更快切換屬性:\n%s「1」或「I」代表智慧，%s「2」或「S」代表力量，%s「3」或「D」代表敏捷\n\n%s右鍵點擊 ^8已配置的節點可切換屬性類型，或將\n未配置節點設為上次使用的屬性\n\n",
	["You can use Ctrl +/- (or Ctrl+Scroll) to zoom in and out and Ctrl+0 to reset.\nThis field also supports different colors.  Using the caret symbol (^) followed by a Hex code or a number (0-9) will set the color.\nBelow are some common color codes PoB uses:	"] = "你可以使用 Ctrl +/- (或 Ctrl+滾輪) 縮放，並使用 Ctrl+0 重設。\n此欄位也支援不同顏色。使用插入符號 (^) 後接十六進位色碼或數字 (0-9) 即可設定顏色。\n以下是 PoB 常用的一些色碼:	",
	["You cannot add support gems to this group, but support gems in\nany other group socketed into %s\nwill automatically apply to the skill."] = "你不能將輔助寶石加入此群組，但鑲嵌在 %s\n內的其他任何群組中的輔助寶石\n都會自動套用到此技能。",
	["You cannot delete this group, but it will disappear if you lose the above sources."] = "你無法刪除此群組，但若你失去上述來源，它就會消失。",
	["You cannot pay Life costs of skills while you have Energy Shield and Eternal Life allocated"] = "你擁有能量護盾且配置了永恆生命時，無法支付技能的生命消耗",
	["You do not have enough %s to use: %s"] = "你的%s不足，無法使用：%s",
	["You do not have enough %s%% to use: %s"] = "你的%s%%不足，無法使用：%s",
	["You do not have enough Accuracy for Precise Technique"] = "你的命中率不足，無法使用精準技巧",
	["You do not meet the Dexterity requirement of"] = "你未達到以下敏捷需求：",
