	["You have 1% less damage taken from hits per stack of fortification:\nHas a default cap of 20 stacks."] = "每層堅固使你受到的擊中傷害降低 1%：\n預設上限為 20 層。",
	["You have too many %s lineage support gems allocated. Max allowed is %s.%s"] = "你配置了太多 %s 血脈輔助寶石。最多允許 %s。%s",
	["You have too many gem groups allocated. Max allowed is %s. You have %s non-item/non-granted gem groups allocated."] = "你配置了太多寶石群組。最多允許 %s。你目前配置了 %s 個非物品/非授予的寶石群組。",
	["You have too many gems in your %s socket group"] = "你的 %s 插槽群組中有太多寶石",
	["You may have too much cast speed or too little cooldown reduction to effectively use %s replacement"] = "你的施放速度可能過高，或冷卻恢復過低，導致無法有效使用 %s 替代",
	["You must log in to use the search feature"] = "必須登入才能使用搜尋功能",
	["You will automatically be considered to be Channeling if your main skill is a channelled skill,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你的主要技能是引導技能，系統會自動視為你正在引導，\n但你可以在必要時用此選項強制指定。",
	["You will automatically be considered to be Leeching if you have '^xE05030Life ^7Leech effects are not removed at Full ^xE05030Life^7',\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你具有『^xE05030生命 ^7偷取效果在滿 ^xE05030生命^7 時不會移除』，系統會自動視為你正在偷取，\n但你可以在必要時用此選項強制指定。",
	["You will automatically be considered to be on Low ^x7070FFMana ^7if you have at least 50% ^x7070FFmana ^7reserved,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你至少保留了 50% 的 ^x7070FF法力 ^7，系統會自動視為你處於低 ^x7070FF法力 ^7狀態，\n但你可以在必要時用此選項強制指定。",
	["You will automatically be considered to be on Low ^x88FFFFEnergy Shield ^7if you have at least 50% ^x88FFFFES ^7reserved,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你至少保留了 50% 的 ^x88FFFFES ^7，系統會自動視為你處於低 ^x88FFFF能量護盾 ^7狀態，\n但你可以在必要時用此選項強制指定。",
	["You will automatically be considered to have Hit Recently if your main skill Hits and is self-cast,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你的主要技能會擊中且為自行施放，系統會自動視為你近期有擊中，\n但你可以在必要時用此選項強制指定。",
	["You will automatically be considered to have Summoned a Totem Recently if your main skill is a Totem,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你的主要技能是圖騰技能，系統會自動視為你近期召喚過圖騰，\n但你可以在必要時用此選項強制指定。",
	["You will automatically be considered to have a Totem if your main skill is a Totem,\nbut you can use this option to force it if necessary."] = "若你的主要技能是圖騰技能，系統會自動視為你有圖騰，\n但你可以在必要時用此選項強制指定。",
	["Your Absolution Skill Damage will not be scaled with Count setting.\nBy default it multiplies both minion count and skill hit count which leads to incorrect\nTotal DPS calculation since Absolution cannot inherently shotgun.\nDo not enable if you use Spell Totem support, Spell Cascade support or similar supports"] = "你的 Absolution 技能傷害不會隨計數設定縮放。\n預設下它會同時乘上僕從數量與技能擊中次數，這會導致總 DPS 計算錯誤，因為 Absolution 本身無法自然 shotgun。\n若你使用 Spell Totem support、Spell Cascade support 或其他類似輔助，請勿啟用",
